    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0732" n="644" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg644"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Bolet Peraza to
                        Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Venezuela</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                                York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-09-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 20, 1892</hi></date>. (Received
                        September 21.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Duly authorized by my Government to buy a steamer and arm it as a cruiser. I beg
                    you to give instructions to proper authorities in this port to avoid me
                    trouble.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. Bolet Peraza</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
